{"version":1,"content":"<p>由3位母親支嚳儀（Venus）、賴慰玲（Winki）及陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne），以真人騷形式主持的親子旅遊節目《玩住學‧學住玩》，昨晚（26日）賴慰玲（Winki）跟囝囝梁進也（也也）的大馬親子之旅來到最終回。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:42:43.610271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:27:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:29.880409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:18.238147+00:00","content_hash":"ea295df87e7ed8d9ff0481a51ca78e5f24e33da18cd1100ee1fe1803c91f38fb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}